        "content": "### What the contract says\n\nSame panels and alerts, generated by `weaver registry generate` from `telemetry-schema/`. The queries use the names **declared in the schema** (`error.type`), which is what the service emits. The error-rate panel shows the real share of failed payments, and the alert on it pages.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "02 - Generated from the telemetry schema",
      "type": "text"
    },
